//// The `jhonstart-link` package — module-tree root.
////
//// Client navigation's RENDER-TIME half (front 27), cut out of the jhonstart
//// core by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/04-jhonstart/modules.md` § 1): `link`
//// (the anchor, its props and the prefetch decision) and `reconcile` (the
//// layout keys and the remount decision of a client transition). Both are
//// PURE — no host cell of any target — so the member declares the workspace's
//// two targets and every assertion runs on both rows. The browser half
//// (`linkMount`, `linkStatus`, the transition driver) is front 68's generated
//// bundle and is not declared here; `modules.md` § 4 records the target
//// question it will raise. A consumer writes `import {Link} from
//// "jhonstart-link";` beside `import {div, a} from "jhonstart";`.

pub mod link;
pub mod reconcile;
